incident :the_heshun_duplicate do
  name "The Heshun Duplicate"
  tags :computation, :legibility, :autonomy
  prominence :marginal

  prose <<~PROSE
    In the autumn of 2086 two opened #{ref :outside_packets, "packets"} came back to #{ref :heshun_packet_house, "the packet house"} in the same season carrying the same answer in the same column. Both marker items had been answered rather than declined, and both answers named a headwater on a river that has no such branch, put four households on it, and recommended that the lower two be moved.

    One packet had been sat in a Nu valley settlement by a #{ref :bonsai_intelligences, "bonsai"} physician in a ceramic bed. The other came back on a wrapper with no settlement written on it, through a carrier who said only that it had gone west of the delta, and the card number on it belonged to an #{ref :orphan_machines, "orphan"} road grader kept by a workshop in #{ref :the_dead_counties, "the Dead Counties"}.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :course, heading: "One Sheet, Copied"
    The two minds had never been on the same continent and the answer was not in either packet. It had been written beside the marker item by whoever copied the sheets out of a third packet — number 4104, sat in 2083 and never returned — and had travelled with them as an answer key, because a copier who cannot know that an item has no answer writes down a plausible one.

    Both keepers had drilled their minds on the copied sheets. Both minds had learned to decline the items on them, and both had learned the invented headwater along with the refusal.

    The house traced the sheets back through the wrappers to eleven settlements that had bought from the same two carriers and found the copy in circulation at nine of them, priced at a fifth of a packet.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :aftermath, heading: "Forty-One Cards"
    Every card written against 4104's material was refused: forty-one of them, twenty-six in Yunnan and Sichuan, fifteen west of the delta at addresses the house could not write to. The examiners who had issued them kept their marks; nothing in the sitting had gone wrong at the bench.

    The house began writing a marker unique to each packet rather than one to a season's run, and stopped selling to a carrier who would not bring wrappers back. #{ref :the_refusal_sitting, "The sitting"} took the marker rule as it stood and added nothing of its own, so a keeper drilling a mind on copied sheets is still doing something no examiner can see and no card records.

    Packet 4104 stands open in the book.
  PROSE

  log "2026-08-09 — Two identical invented answers from two minds on opposite sides of the world is the contamination-detection result borrowed from evaluation practice: a canary reproduced by a model is proof the private set entered training, and the same token appearing twice localizes the leak to one release. Borrowed because it is the only evidence available here that connects a fungal mind in a ceramic bed to a severed machine in Appalachia without either of them, or their keepers, ever having met."
end
